            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你與基線保持平衡，中等強度是明智的選擇"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. The coach needs a connection; everything else in NOOP keeps working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist offline. Der Coach benötigt eine Verbindung; alles andere in NOOP funktioniert weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're offline. The coach needs a connection; everything else in NOOP keeps working."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No tienes conexión. El Coach necesita conectarse; todo lo demás en NOOP sigue funcionando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous êtes hors ligne. Le Coach a besoin d’une connexion ; tout le reste de NOOP continue de fonctionner."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sei offline. Il Coach richiede una connessione; tutto il resto di NOOP continua a funzionare."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás offline. O Coach precisa de uma ligação; tudo o resto no NOOP continua a funcionar."
